# 10. Product Advertising Score

GEM should calculate a product advertising score.

Example factors:

```text
Conversion Rate
Revenue
ROAS
Margin
Inventory Availability
Demand Trend
Product Popularity
CTR
Add-to-Cart Rate
Refund Rate
Return Rate
Promotion Strength
Seasonality
Store Performance
```

Example:

```text
Product Score
----------------
Demand              92
Conversion          88
Margin              81
Inventory           95
ROAS                91
Trend               94
Refund Risk         72

Overall Score       89
```

The scoring model must be configurable and versioned.

---

# 11. Inventory-Aware Advertising

GEM must consider inventory before recommending advertising.

Example:

```text
Available Stock < minimum advertising threshold
        ↓
Reduce recommendation score
        ↓
Potentially exclude product
```

If:

```text
InventoryDepleted
```

then:

```text
Product advertising eligibility = BLOCKED
```

When inventory recovers:

```text
InventoryRestored
        ↓
Recalculate eligibility
```

Never use Redis as inventory truth.

Read authoritative availability from the Inventory domain/read model.

