# 18. Advertising Provider Abstraction

Never couple GEM directly to Meta, Google, TikTok, or another advertising platform.

Use an adapter interface.

```typescript
interface AdvertisingProvider {
  createCampaign(input): Promise<Result>;
  updateCampaign(input): Promise<Result>;
  pauseCampaign(input): Promise<Result>;
  createAdSet(input): Promise<Result>;
  createCreative(input): Promise<Result>;
  createAd(input): Promise<Result>;
  getInsights(input): Promise<Result>;
}
```

Providers:

```text
MetaAdsProvider
GoogleAdsProvider
TikTokAdsProvider
FutureProvider
```

GEM decides WHAT should happen.

The provider adapter decides HOW the platform API performs it.

