# 63. Definition of Done

GEM is not complete until:

* Product recommendations work.
* Product eligibility is enforced.
* Inventory-aware advertising works.
* Recommendations are explainable.
* AI outputs are schema validated.
* AI outputs pass business policies.
* Campaign execution is idempotent.
* Multi-store isolation works.
* Multi-vendor isolation works.
* Admin approval works.
* Automation levels work.
* Meta integration is provider-isolated.
* Analytics feedback reaches GEM.
* Experiments are tracked.
* Performance is measurable.
* AI cost is measurable.
* Audit logs exist.
* Queue retries/DLQ exist.
* Security tests pass.
* Integration tests pass.
* Unit tests pass.
* No authoritative commerce domain is duplicated inside GEM.

